      "description": "Description:\n\nSTREPSILS Cool Blister Pack 24'sStop sore & itchy throat before it gets worse. Try Strepsils Cool Sensation lozenges for that instant cooling sensation in your throat.Strepsils Cool antibacterial lozenges provide fast soothing and effective relief from sore throats. Each lozenge contains a combination of antibacterials to help kill the bacteria which can cause sore throat and mouth infections. It contains cooling menthol for that instant cooling sensation in the throat.Ingredients:Each lozenge contains 1.2 mg Dichlorobenzyl Alcohol/600 mcg AmylmetacresolStorage Instructions:Store at temperatures not exceeding 30øC\n\n\n\nInstruction: \n\nUsage Information:Adults and Children: Dissolve one lozenge in the mouth every 2 to 3 hours or as prescribed by the physician. If symptoms persist consult your doctor.\n\n\n\nIngredients:\n\nEach lozenge contains 1.2 mg Dichlorobenzyl Alcohol/600 mcg Amylmetacresol\n\n\n\nProduct warning:\n\nSafety InformationKeep out of reach of children.\n\n\n\nCountry of Origin:\n\n\n\nThailand\n\n\n\nShelflife:\n\n360 Days",
